#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:2
msgid "How to manage your subscription"
msgstr "如何管理你的订阅"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:4
msgid ""
"We want to make it easy to manage your billing information. All "
":doc:`organization owners </commercial/subscriptions>` can manage the "
"subscription for that organization. It's easy to achieve a number of common "
"tasks in this dashboard:"
msgstr ""
"我们希望让账单信息管理变得简单。所有 :doc:`组织所有者 </commercial/subscriptions>` "
"都能管理该组织的订阅。在此面板中可轻松完成多项常见任务："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:8
msgid "Update your credit card information."
msgstr "更新你的信用卡信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:9
msgid "Upgrade, downgrade, or cancel your plan."
msgstr "升级、降级或取消套餐。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:10
msgid "View, download, and pay invoices."
msgstr "查看、下载和支付发票。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:11
msgid "Add additional tax (VAT/EIN) or contact email addresses on your invoices."
msgstr "在发票上添加额外的税务信息（VAT/EIN）或联系邮箱地址。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:13
msgid ""
"You can always find our most up-to-date pricing information on our `pricing "
"page <https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/>`_."
msgstr "你始终可以在我们的 `pricing page <https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/>`_ 上查看最新定价信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:16
msgid "Managing your subscription"
msgstr "管理你的订阅"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:18
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `subscription management page "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/organizations/choose/subscription_detail/>`__."
msgstr ""
"前往 `subscription management page "
"<https://app.readthedocs.com/organizations/choose/subscription_detail/>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:19
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Manage Subscription`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Manage Subscription` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:21
msgid ""
"This action will take you to the Stripe billing portal where you can manage "
"your subscription."
msgstr "此操作会带你进入 Stripe 账单门户，你可在其中管理订阅。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:24
msgid ""
"You will need to be an organization owner to view subscription information. "
"If you do not have permission, you can ask one of your existing organization"
" owners to make any required changes."
msgstr "查看订阅信息需要组织所有者权限。若你没有该权限，可请现有组织所有者代为完成所需更改。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:29
msgid "Cancelling your subscription"
msgstr "取消订阅"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:31
msgid ""
"Cancelling your subscription can be done following the instructions in "
"`Managing your subscription`_. Your subscription will remain active for the "
"remainder of the current billing period, and will not renew for the next "
"billing period."
msgstr "可按 `Managing your subscription`_ 中的说明取消订阅。你的订阅在当前计费周期剩余时间内保持有效，下一计费周期不再续费。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:35
msgid ""
"**We cannot cancel subscriptions through an email request, as email is an "
"insecure method of verifying a user's identity.** If you email us about "
"this, we require you to verify your identity by logging into your Read the "
"Docs account and submitting an official support request there."
msgstr ""
"**我们无法通过邮件请求取消订阅，因为邮件不是验证用户身份的安全方式。** 若就此发邮件联系我们，你需要登录 Read the Docs "
"账户并在其中提交正式支持请求以验证身份。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:41
msgid "Billing information"
msgstr "账单信息"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:43
msgid ""
"We provide both monthly and annual subscriptions for all plans. Annual plans"
" are given a 2 month discount compared to monthly billing. We support credit"
" card billing for all plans. Pro and Enterprise plans can use invoice-based "
"and PO billing for annual subscriptions."
msgstr ""
"所有套餐都提供按月和按年订阅。年付套餐相比月付享有 2 个月的折扣。所有套餐均支持信用卡账单。Pro 和 Enterprise "
"套餐的年度订阅可使用发票账单和 PO 账单。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:49
msgid ""
"We recommend paying by credit card for all users, as this greatly simplifies"
" the billing process."
msgstr "我们建议所有用户使用信用卡付款，这能极大简化账单流程。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:53
msgid "Discounts and credits"
msgstr "折扣与抵扣"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:55
msgid ""
"We do not generally discount our software. We provide an ad-supported "
"service to the community with |org_brand|, but we do have one standard "
"discount that we offer."
msgstr "我们通常不提供软件折扣。通过 |org_brand| 我们以广告支持的方式向社区提供服务，但也提供一项标准折扣。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:60
msgid "Non-profit and academic organizations"
msgstr "非营利与学术组织"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:62
msgid ""
"Our community hosting, provided for open source projects, is generally where"
" we recommend most academic projects to host their projects. If you have "
"constraints on how public your documentation can be, our commercial hosting "
"is probably a better fit."
msgstr "我们面向开源项目提供的社区托管，通常是多数学术项目托管项目的推荐选择。若你的文档公开程度受限，商业托管可能更适合。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/commercial/subscriptions.rst:68
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We offer a 50% discount on all of our commercial plans to certified academic"
" and non-profit organizations. Please contact :doc:`/support` to request "
"this discount."
msgstr "我们对经认证的学术和非营利组织提供所有商业套餐 50% 的折扣。请联系 :doc:`/support` 申请该折扣。"

